Z||000000||David Gamache||06-18-2000||05:30 PM||||I finally broke down and picked up a ez-link Auto Xray scanner instead of having to guess which electrical parts might be failing, but I am not entirely sure of all the readings. Some are common sense, while others could be off a point or two and i could not tell for sure if it was a problem. If anyone has one of these and has used it on a 87-88 fiero coupe or GT (4 & 6 cyl)when there car has been in proper working order and if you could post the readings they would be helpful to use as comparison readings.<BR> Even the dealer service manual recommends checking readings between cars. Unfortunately, not being a dealer this can be a little tricky. Any help would be great.<BR>Thanks,<BR>David ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Terrybogin||06-18-2000||09:12 PM||||I have access to my son's scanner. What does your's show and I will see if his will help you any.||||reg||1
Z||000002||David Gamache||06-19-2000||12:52 PM||||These are the readings after the vehicle is warm for both the 88 4-cyc,5-speed and 87 6-cyc,automatic.<P>                         4-cyc     6-cyc<P>Prom ID                 9562       4322<BR>coolant temp            207.0 F    200.3 F<BR>start coolant temp      63.9 F<BR>throttle sensor          0.50 volts  0.68 V<BR>throttle angle             0%<BR>engine rpm               1000 rpm  1000 rpm<BR>vehicle speed              0          0<BR>oxygen sensor            818 mVolts  642 mV<BR>o2 cross counts           71       11<BR>block learn              135       120<BR>intergrator              126       128<BR>idle air motor pos       17 steps  44 steps<BR>desired idle pos         17 steps<BR>desired idle             1000 rpm<BR>barometric pressure      4.48 volts<BR>map senor                0.90 volts  1.39 V<BR>vacuum sensor            4.15 volts<BR>manifold air temp        150.3 F     95.0 F<BR>batt voltage             14.1 volts  14.1 V<BR>spark advance            38.1        29.7<BR>egr duty cycle            -          0.0%<BR>injector pulse            0.9 mS     1.6 mS<BR>desired a/f mix           14.6<BR>engine run time             -<BR>cruse set speed            25 mph<BR>battery voltage high        no        no<BR>a/c clutch                disabled<BR>fuel cut off                 "<BR>clear flood mode             off<BR>learn control             enabled   enabled<BR>batt voltage low             no     no<BR>Async mode                 on<BR>rich lean flag            rich      rich<BR>loop status               closed    open<BR>cruse switch               off<BR>brake depressed            yes<BR>       (brake was not being ^ depressed?)<BR>cruse set/coast             off<BR>cruse res/accel              "<BR>a/c                   not requested    n/r<BR>fan 1                        off<BR>tcc status                 not locked  n/l<BR>park/neutral           not detected  Detected<BR>a/c                        disabled<BR>idle air coil A motor        on<BR> "    "   "   B  "           "<BR>oxygen sensor               ready<BR>IAC motor reset             yes<BR>fan 2                        off<BR>a/c forced off                no<BR> <BR>Thats all the readings. I look foward to comparing notes.||||reg||1
